 in-x) var(--origin-y)\; } ABOUT THE ARTIST Zaida Jalhk is a Colombian film
 maker and visual storyteller based in Brisbane. Her work is driven by an i
 nterest in finding different ways to tell stories. Throughout her creative
  practice\, she has explored the combination of live-action\, animation\, 
 photography and written forms\, using each medium as part of the storytell
 ing process. This experimental approach allows her to create narratives wh
 ere images\, words and different visual languages come together to communi
 cate emotions\, ideas and human experiences. #block-yui_3_17_2_1_178867903
